desc: Delete the leading X from each line
category: manual
par: 4
hint1: Visual block selects the same column across lines
hint2: Ctrl-V down the first column, then x deletes the selection
solution: <C-V>jjx
note: <C-V> selects a block down the first column (jj), x deletes the selected characters.
--- START ---
Xapple
Xbanana
Xcherry
--- GOAL ---
apple
banana
cherry
--- END ---
